cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying paper, please cite it as below."
title: "EFFACE: Finding the Most Effective Meaning-Preserving Attack Chain against SynthID-Text-Class Watermarks"
abstract: >-
  A study of how much of a SynthID-Text-style statistical text watermark survives
  meaning-preserving rewriting, and of which single tactic or ordered chain of up
  to three tactics removes the mark most reliably at a fixed semantic floor.
